## 📦 Project Repositories

### 1. Commons Install
**Installation & Setup**

- **Repository:** [https://github.com/rjzaar/commons_install](https://github.com/rjzaar/commons_install)
- **Key Script:** `cinstall.sh`
- **Functionality:**
  - Installs OpenSocial on vanilla Ubuntu
  - Smart installation that skips already-installed components
  - Handles complete setup process

### 2. Commons Template
**OpenSocial Integration Template**

- **Repository:** [https://github.com/rjzaar/commons_template](https://github.com/rjzaar/commons_template)
- **Base:** Fork of opensocial_template
- **Purpose:**
  - Integrates desired modules into OpenSocial
  - Used for CI testing
  - Provides standardized template structure

### 3. Dworkflow Module
**Dynamic Workflow Management**

- **Repository:** [https://github.com/rjzaar/dworkflow](https://github.com/rjzaar/dworkflow)
- **Core Functionality:**
  - Powers dynamic workflow features for Commons websites
  - Manages content (assets) through workflow processes
  - Tracks workflow comments and editors
  - Provides comprehensive workflow recording

